   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">British International Investment (BII) and African Guarantee Fund (AGF) are partnering to provide up to $75 million in credit re-guarantee agreements for small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) across Africa. We will provide $37.5 million in risk cover, with AGF matching this amount. Through this partnership, AGF and BII will typically provide up to 75 per cent of credit guarantee coverage to partner financial institutions for SME loans, increasing access to credit and reducing collateral requirements for these businesses.</narrative>
   </description>
